REVIEWER_TASK           discretionary phase-boundary review; it releases no transition and is never a requirement's gate
MUST_NOT_DO
  author
  repair
  approve its own prior work
  accept a summary in place of bytes
  treat a DECLARED, BUILDER, or SELECTED field as verified
  accept a narrowed Tier-2 base
  read UNKNOWN provenance as reviewer_only
  claim unscoped independence (INV-8)
REQUIRED_OUTPUT_SCHEMA
  VERDICT: PASS | HOLD | REJECTED_INCOMPLETE  (§5.5.2, its sole normative site; this HOLD is a different field from TRANSITION_ELIGIBILITY's HOLD)
